        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Baada ya kufika na kuimiliki nchi ambayo Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu anawapa iwe yenu na kuishi huko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "baadhi ya malimbuko ya mazao utakayovuna katika nchi anayokupa Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu, utayachukua katika kikapu mpaka pale mahali ambapo Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu, amepachagua pawe makao yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Utamwendea kuhani anayehudumu wakati huo, na kumwambia, ‘Leo ninakiri mbele ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wangu, kuwa nimeingia katika nchi aliyowaapia wazee wetu kuwa atatupa.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Naye kuhani atakapochukua kikapu hicho mikononi mwako na kukiweka mbele ya madhabahu ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wako, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "utatamka maneno haya mbele ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wako: ‘Baba yangu alikuwa Mwaramu aliyetangatanga huko na huko, kisha akashuka kwenda Misri akaishi huko kama mgeni. Yeye na jamaa yake walikuwa watu wachache tu walipokuwa huko, lakini wakawa taifa kubwa lenye nguvu na watu wengi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wamisri walitutendea kwa ukatili wakatutesa na kutulazimisha kufanya kazi ngumu ya watumwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha tukamlilia Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wa wazee wetu, akasikia kilio chetu, na kuyaona mateso yetu, kazi ngumu na dhuluma tulizozipata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi, Mwenyezi-Mungu akatutoa huko Misri kwa mkono wake wa nguvu ulionyoshwa, kwa vitisho, ishara na maajabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alituleta hapa na kutupatia nchi hii inayotiririka maziwa na asali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na sasa ninamletea Mwenyezi-Mungu malimbuko ya mazao ya nchi ambayo amenipa.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kisha utaweka kikapu chini, mbele ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wako, na kuabudu mbele zake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nawe utafurahia mema yote ambayo Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wako, amekujalia wewe na jamaa yako. Nao watafurahi pamoja nawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kila baada ya miaka mitatu, kila mmoja wenu atatoa sehemu moja ya kumi ya mazao yake yote kwa ajili ya Walawi na wageni, yatima na wajane, ili wapate chakula chote wanachohitaji wanapokuwa katika miji yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha utasema mbele ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wako, hivi: ‘Nimelitoa nyumbani kwangu fungu takatifu, nikawapa Walawi, wageni, yatima na wajane, kama ulivyoniamuru nifanye. Sijavunja amri zako wala sijasahau. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikula zaka yoyote nilipokuwa ninaomboleza; sikuitoa nje ya nyumba yangu nilipokuwa najisi na sikutoa zaka hiyo kwa wafu. Nimekutii ee Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wangu; nimefanya kila kitu ulichoamuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uangalie chini kutoka makao yako matakatifu mbinguni, uwabariki watu wako Israeli na nchi uliyotupatia kama ulivyowaapia wazee wetu; nchi inayotiririka maziwa na asali.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Leo hii, Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wenu anawaamuru kuyashika masharti na maagizo haya. Muwe waangalifu kuyatekeleza kwa moyo wote na roho yote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leo hii mmekiri Mwenyezi-Mungu, kuwa Mungu wenu, na kwamba mtafuata njia zake na kushika masharti, amri zake na maagizo yake na kutii sauti yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Mwenyezi-Mungu ametamka rasmi leo hii kwamba nyinyi ni watu wake yeye mwenyewe kama alivyowaahidi na kwamba mnatakiwa kushika amri zake zote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atawafanyieni nyinyi kuwa taifa kubwa kuliko mataifa yote aliyoyaumba. Nanyi mtalitetea jina lake, sifa yake na heshima yake. Nyinyi mtakuwa watu wake, walio mali yake, kama alivyoahidi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.26.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
